  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e60c557ade5177f4aa12d6e07302b96f, type: 3}
  m_Name: FoxIntroduction
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_SpeakerName: Fox
  m_Lines:
  - A rabbit helped me when I was lost and hungry, a long time ago.
  - I never had a chance to thank my friend. I want to repay that kindness.
  - Will you help me find that rabbit? Follow the glowing blue paw prints. I will
    come with you.
